      "caveats": "The findings are based on a scoping review of existing literature rather than new empirical data or physical testing of vertiport designs.",
      "what": "This study synthesizes the literature on urban air mobility vertiports by conducting a bibliometric mapping and qualitative scoping review of 81 peer-reviewed papers published between 2015 and 2025. It maps how research has evolved from basic spatial coverage models to more complex analyses incorporating wind, noise, equity, land-use compatibility, and multimodal ground integration.",
